WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.799
In the year 1911, the Wuchang Uprising broke out.

00:00:03.799 --> 00:00:07.584
The young soldiers rose up and took action during the night.

00:00:07.584 --> 00:00:11.950
Outside the window, the Yangtze River flowed quietly under the moonlight.

00:00:12.153 --> 00:00:15.593
At dawn, the city of Wuchang had raised a new flag.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.630
The news spread quickly, and provinces responded one after another.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:23.603
A bright light shooting into the sky woke the people of the whole city.

00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:27.297
One province after another declared independence from the Qing court.

00:00:27.297 --> 00:00:31.421
The rule of the Qing dynasty became precarious and on the verge of collapse.

00:00:31.421 --> 00:00:35.443
Inside the imperial palace in Beijing, the atmosphere was quiet yet tense.

00:00:35.443 --> 00:00:38.042
Emperor Puyi was only five years old at the time.

00:00:38.042 --> 00:00:42.401
City after city seemed to be awakened by the morning light.

00:00:42.401 --> 00:00:45.878
In the year 1912, Puyi announced his abdication.

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:48.401
The imperial system of more than two thousand years came to an end.

00:00:48.401 --> 00:00:51.633
His mother held him and gently shook her head.

00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:55.001
The Qing dynasty's rule of nearly three hundred years came to an end.

00:00:55.001 --> 00:00:57.308
Chinese history entered a new era.
